{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Beside the sin-offering of atonement.</b> The goat offered inside, which is stated in Acharei Mot — for it too is a sin-offering." "<b>And the burnt-offering of the daily.</b> And besides the burnt-offering of the daily offering, you shall offer these burnt-offerings." "<b>And their drink-offerings.</b> The verse turns back to the additional offerings written above and to 'you shall offer' — and it is in the language of command: besides the burnt-offering of the daily offering and its meal-offering, you shall offer these and their drink-offerings. And so all 'their drink-offerings' mentioned in all the festivals, except for the offerings of the festival [of Sukkot] — for every 'and its drink-offering,' 'and their drink-offerings,' and 'her drink-offerings' that appear in it turn back to the daily offering, and are not in the language of command, since the drink-offerings of the additional offerings are written on their own for each and every day."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:14.573722816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}